{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/433d1b043dc75b320b1e9e405e10faa8.poster.avif?t=1754923149\" width=604 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/433d1b043dc75b320b1e9e405e10faa8.webm?t=1754923149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><u><strong>A PILGRIMAGE TOWARD REPENTANCE</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a Ward of Corvus and carve your way through the interconnected islands of the Risacca Archipelago to end the evil consuming this world. Face formidable enemies in epic battles and uncover countless secrets with every new sacrificial attempt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/910d23e4764c6da2e11711c32635ec97.poster.avif?t=1754923149\" width=604 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/910d23e4764c6da2e11711c32635ec97.webm?t=1754923149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/910d23e4764c6da2e11711c32635ec97.mp4?t=1754923149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><u><strong>EACH ATTEMPT IS UNIQUE</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Risacca Archipelago is ravaged by tides and corruption. Every run offers the opportunity to explore a new path leading to the ultimate sacrifice. Enemies, chests, and rewards awaiting you will vary with each attempt. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/90a2da086de3227a5bbf8b17434d7fb3.poster.avif?t=1754923149\" width=604 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/90a2da086de3227a5bbf8b17434d7fb3.webm?t=1754923149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/90a2da086de3227a5bbf8b17434d7fb3.mp4?t=1754923149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>EVERY DECISION MATTERS</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware, Ward! Every choice you make binds you to your fate. The path to the gate is fraught with traps and deadly encounters. Haste will be your downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/b0412a665d6923a07371900712afcd87.poster.avif?t=1754923149\" width=604 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/b0412a665d6923a07371900712afcd87.webm?t=1754923149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/b0412a665d6923a07371900712afcd87.mp4?t=1754923149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>FORGE YOUR DESTINY</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather and upgrade your weapons and equipment throughout your trials. Accept the blessings of the Embrace and wield its powers to amplify your abilities. Discover countless character builds and configurations as you progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/a03c7aed8bfe7046a67836d40c8edeeb.poster.avif?t=1754923149\" width=604 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/a03c7aed8bfe7046a67836d40c8edeeb.webm?t=1754923149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>A DARK FANTASTIC WORLD</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a dark fantasy, set in breathtaking environments designed to make your journey as perilous as a voyage through hell itself.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1490990?t=1754923149","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1490990?t=1754923149","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/e881f0ec025b5148f576af8396a4b9e0eede84b7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754923149","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/e881f0ec025b5148f576af8396a4b9e0eede84b7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754923149","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/433d1b043dc75b320b1e9e405e10faa8.poster.avif?t=1754923149\" width=604 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/433d1b043dc75b320b1e9e405e10faa8.webm?t=1754923149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><u><strong>A PILGRIMAGE TOWARD REPENTANCE</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a Ward of Corvus and carve your way through the interconnected islands of the Risacca